# __NAME__

A small Rastrillo app: one page, no database, no sign-in.

    go run ./cmd/__NAME__ -addr 127.0.0.1:8080
    go test ./...

Add a page: add a route and handler in internal/__PKG__/app.go, create a
template in internal/__PKG__/templates/, and add its name to `newPages`
in internal/__PKG__/render.go. To store data, create an app with
`rastrillo new --scaffold single` and move your pages into it.
